    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/345678ijhbvde567uikjnbvcrtyu.JPG\" style=\"width: 322px; height: 158px;\" /><br />Point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> is <math><mi>S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Hence, using section formula <math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let, reflection of P about the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is <math><msup><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> which lies on the side <math><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> equation of <math><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Point of intersection of <math><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7,7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi></math>",
